hints.pseudocode:
need counts; missing = len(need); left = 0; best = infinity
for right in 0..n-1:
  if count[text[right]] > 0: missing--
  count[text[right]]--
  while missing == 0:
    best = min(best, right - left + 1)
    count[text[left]]++; if count[text[left]] > 0: missing++
    left++
return best (or 0)
